# Copy to `.env` in project root (do not commit `.env`)

VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=your-email@example.com
VITE_WHATSAPP_URL=https://wa.me/000000000000
VITE_LINKEDIN_URL=https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-profile/
VITE_GITHUB_URL=https://github.com/your-username

## Live deploy (Vercel)

Contact cards and links are baked in at **build time**. Add the same four variables in:

**Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables** (Production + Preview)

Then **Redeploy** (Deployments → … → Redeploy). Without these, Email / WhatsApp / LinkedIn / GitHub buttons will not appear on the live site.
